@startuml Code_HeatingAutomationSequence
title Код: автоматическое управление отоплением по показанию температуры

participant "Temperature\nMonitoring Service" as Temp
queue "Message Broker\n(RabbitMQ)" as Broker
participant "Heating Control Service\n: Automation Handler" as Automation
participant "Heating Control Service\n: Command Dispatcher" as Dispatcher
database "Heating DB" as HeatingDb
participant "Оборудование\nотопления" as Equip
participant "Heating Control Service\n: Event Publisher" as Publisher
participant "Notification Service" as Notif

Temp -> Broker : publish TemperatureUpdated\n(homeId, sensorId, value)
Broker -> Automation : deliver TemperatureUpdated

Automation -> HeatingDb : получить целевую\nтемпературу и текущее\nсостояние отопления (homeId)
HeatingDb --> Automation : targetTemperature, currentState

alt value < targetTemperature AND currentState == Off
    Automation -> Dispatcher : TurnOn(homeId)
    Dispatcher -> Equip : POST /heating/on
    Equip --> Dispatcher : 200 OK (ack)
    Dispatcher -> HeatingDb : сохранить state = On
    Dispatcher -> Publisher : уведомить об изменении
    Publisher -> Broker : publish HeatingStateChanged\n(homeId, On)
    Broker -> Notif : deliver HeatingStateChanged
    Notif -> Notif : сформировать и отправить\nуведомление пользователю
else value >= targetTemperature AND currentState == On
    Automation -> Dispatcher : TurnOff(homeId)
    Dispatcher -> Equip : POST /heating/off
    Equip --> Dispatcher : 200 OK (ack)
    Dispatcher -> HeatingDb : сохранить state = Off
    Dispatcher -> Publisher : уведомить об изменении
    Publisher -> Broker : publish HeatingStateChanged\n(homeId, Off)
    Broker -> Notif : deliver HeatingStateChanged
else состояние уже соответствует нужному
    Automation -> Automation : ничего не делать
end

@enduml
